# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
# Templates carry no secrets and must be committed.
!.env*.example

# 实际使用的那份编排，和 .env 同一个道理：模板进仓库，实例不进。本机开发按自己
# 的习惯改，服务器上那份由部署工作流从模板生成。
/docker-compose.yml

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
